  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pilot Project for Global Big Data-Based Clinical Researchers AI Search and Recommendation Services in Vietnam (Seed1/2024-2025/3 million won)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving access to information of healthcare organizations and clinical trial investigators to increase the possibilities of diagnosis and treatment for critically ill patients through clinical trial screening.1. &#xc194;&#xb8e8;&#xc158; &#xb3c4;&#xc785; &#xc804; &#xb300;&#xbe44; &#xbca0;&#xd2b8;&#xb0a8; &#xd604;&#xc9c0; CRO &#xac80;&#xc0c9; &#xc2dc;&#xac04; &#xac10;&#xc18c;&#xc728; 30%, 2. GCP(Good Clinical Practice) &#xad50;&#xc721; &#xc218;&#xb8cc;&#xb97c; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xc784;&#xc0c1;&#xc2dc;&#xd5d8; &#xc5f0;&#xad6c;&#xcc38;&#xc5ec; &#xac00;&#xb2a5;&#xc790; &#xc591;&#xc131;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To build a clinical trial researcher search platform to find and match suitable participants and researchers for clinical trials reducing failure rates and improving efficiency to overcome the limitations of the lack of clinical trial infrastructure and low quality of healthcare in Vietnam.</narrative>
  </description>
